# letting go slides down); platforms stacked by the wall are jumped up
# through, one at a time, landing on each; rope hung under a beam grows down
# the line each time rope is placed on it, is climbed, and falls when cut.
# worldcraft --demo demos/climbing.demo --demo-out demo_out
