# Grass spreads over dirt by itself: now and then (a random tick, about once
# every 30 seconds for each block), a grass block looks at one cell of the
# 3x3x3 around it, diagonals too, and turns it to grass if it's dirt with
# nothing opaque on top. Checks that a checkerboard of grass and dirt fills
# in, and that dirt touching the field only diagonally (a row a block up and
# a block down, past its east edge) turns too; dirt under stone doesn't.
# worldcraft --demo demos/grass_spread.demo --demo-out demo_out --gif demo_out/grass_spread.gif --gif-fps 2
