# Iron tools (#188): iron ore cooks into iron ingots in a furnace, and iron
# ingots and sticks make iron tools, each better than its stone one. Here
# a stone pickaxe can't break iron ore in 0.45 s (it takes 0.6); the ore is
# cooked into ingots, an iron pickaxe is crafted at a crafting table, and it
# can (0.375). Then a stone sword (8) doesn't kill a cow (10) in one hit;
# an iron one (12) does.
