# Going east: a slab, east-facing stairs, a stone block with a slab on it,
# a stone block with stairs on it, then a stone block, each half a block
# higher than the last, up to two blocks above the ground; then a wall, so
# the walk ends in a known place. The space is cleared, with a stone floor,
