# Mobs put out lights, going as near them as they can first: a skeleton
# with a clear line to a torch walks up to it and snuffs it; one that sees
# its torch through a glass wall walks round to the far side and snuffs it;
# one walled off from its torch by stone leaves it lit; one going for the
# player puts out a torch on its way, but not one behind it; and one that
# sees its torch through glass and can get to its far side, but not to both
# sides of it, leaves it lit until a gap lets it round.
# worldcraft --demo demos/snuff.demo --demo-out demo_out
seed 1
mobs off
view 5
window 1280 720

wait_loaded
mark
# Night, so the skeletons don't fade away in the daylight.
time 0.0
god on

